=======================
Method Used                        	Thread State of Caller
join()	                            WAITING
join(timeout)	                    TIMED_WAITING
sleep(timeout)	                    TIMED_WAITING
wait()	                            WAITING
wait(timeout)	                    TIMED_WAITING
LockSupport.park()	                WAITING
LockSupport.parkNanos()	            TIMED_WAITING


